    "title": "High school roundup for Dec. 20, 2025: Oakland Catholic wins battle of WPIAL title contenders - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By TribLive ,\n4 days ago Belle Vernon defenders trap Greensburg Central’s Luke Semelka during their game on Saturday, Dec. 20, 2025, at Jeannette. (Christopher Horner | TribLive) Savanna Daye connected for 21 points to lead Class 4A No. 2 Oakland Catholic to a 60-41 victory over Class 3A No. 1 Shady Side Academy in a matchup of WPIAL title contenders at the PBC Hall of Fame Classic at Ambridge on Saturday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
